-- src:810 | không được đề cập trong bất kỳ tài liệu cụ thể nào.

§§ `GC3. Alterations`

-- Cover ceases for the property, liability or injury affected by any of these changes,
-- unless the Insurer or its representative endorses its consent on the policy before the
-- loss: (a) use of the Insured Location other than as a residence; (b) a change in the
-- precautions or circumstances that increases the risk; (c) insured property moved to any
-- other building or place; (d) the insured Home, or one containing insured property, left
-- vacant for more than 30 days; (e) the Insured's interest passing otherwise than by will or
-- operation of law.
