§§ `GC7. Forfeiture`

-- (a) All benefit is forfeited if the claim is fraudulent in any respect, or the Insured or
-- anyone for the Insured uses fraudulent means or devices, or the loss or liability was
-- caused by the wilful act or with the connivance of the Insured.
